{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"state","trigger":"plausible","reason":"After a restart with an unavailable executor and changed checkout, the factory permanently deletes the persisted cleanup handle while leaving the remote workflow and branches in place."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"resume","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A restart after a retry completes but before the enclosing stage saves its result discards the completed retry and repeats gate work."},{"id":"F3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A primary GitHub API quota exhaustion returns HTTP 403 and causes a gate error instead of waiting for the supplied reset time."},{"id":"F4","consequence":"nuisance","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A restart during a rate-limit cooldown causes an early poll and another wait, generating avoidable requests without changing the demonstrated gate result."}]}